  {
    "id": "careplan.early_visit.body",
    "locale": "en",
    "title": "Early postpartum visit",
    "body": "A visit with your practice in the first three weeks after birth. The clinician checks how your body is healing and answers your questions. Bring your questions and a list of any medicines you take. If you need a ride or an interpreter, tell the practice before the visit.",
