    "id": "careplan.comprehensive_visit.body",
    "locale": "en",
    "title": "Comprehensive postpartum visit",
    "body": "A full visit around six weeks after birth. It covers your recovery, your mood, birth control if you want it, and what comes next. Bring your questions, your medicine list, and your insurance card. This visit is a good time to ask about anything that is still open.",
