    "locale": "en",
    "title": "Feeding support",
    "body": "However you feed your baby, help is available if it is hard. Your practice can connect you with feeding support in the first week. Sore nipples, low supply, or trouble with a bottle are all reasons to ask. Tell your coordinator and they will set it up.",
